    routePath: 'nap',
    LLM: 'Game: Nap (Napoleon). Type: Trick-taking/Bidding. Players: 3-8. Cards: 5 each. Bids: Three=3, Four=4, Nap=5, Wellington=10, BlÃ¼cher=20. High bidder leads and names trumps. Must follow suit. Scoring: Stake-based per bid level.',
    Player: "Welcome to Nap. You hold five cards and one chance to bid. Will you play it safe with Three, go for broke with Nap, or challenge an opponent's bid with Wellington? Rememberâ€”follow suit, trump wisely, and don't let the bidder win their quota.",
    tagline: 'Bid bold, play smart, and rememberâ€”the Duke of Wellington always beats Napoleon.',
    gameCategory: 'Trick-taking',
